<title>POLAND: STOMIL APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 4.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 4.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.80 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.20 vs   0.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.12 vs   0.13</p>
<p> Sales		   55.89 vs  54.58</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    20.02 vs  15.65</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	27.18 vs  26.17</p>
<p> Operating profit    31.11 vs  22.24</p>
<p> Sales		  217.12 vs 200.65</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
